  "word_count": 820,
  "body_markdown": "(310)-481-0111\n\nDental Implants\n\nDental Implant Surgery\n\nAll-on-4® Dental Implants\n\nHybrid Fixed Detachable Denture\n\nZirconia Fixed Bridge\n\nImplant Supported Dentures\n\nRobotic Surgery\n\nCost & Compare\n\nWhat To Expect\n\nFAQ\n\nAesthetic Dentistry\n\nCosmetic Dentistry\n\nPorcelain Veneers & Lumineers\n\nInvisalign\n\nTeeth Whitening\n\nSmile Makeover\n\nServices\n\nIV Sedation\n\nBone Grafting\n\nRidge Augmentation\n\nSinus Augmentation\n\nTooth Extractions\n\nGeneral Dentistry\n\nPeriodontics\n\nConditions We Treat\n\nMissing Teeth\n\nBone Loss\n\nFailing Dental Implants\n\nLoose Dentures\n\nPatient Center\n\nInsurance & Financing\n\nOur Facility\n\nPatient Stories\n\nBefore & After Photos\n\nWho We Are\n\nCommitment To Excellence\n\nMeet Dr. Tony Barriere\n\nMeet The Team\n\nVideo Library\n\nBlog\n\nContact Us\n\nPatient Portal\n\nNew Patients\n\nCurrent Patients\n\n\n# What To Expect\n\n\n\n# What to Expect - Los Angeles, CA\n\n\n\n## We Excel at Implant Dentistry\n\n\n\n## Take the First Step Toward a Lifetime of Smiles\n\n\nWhether you need to replace a single tooth or all your teeth, dental implants are an excellent long-term investment in your health. The first step in the process is scheduling your consultation with Dr. Barriere at West LA Implants. After we guide you through the process of getting your dental implants, we’ll customize your treatment plan. From there, you can expect a dramatically better smile and improved overall health! Even if other dentists have told you that you don’t qualify for dental implants, Dr. Barriere may be able to help you. Schedule your free second opinion today!\n\nGet Pricing\n\n\n## The West LA Implants Process\n\n\n\n#### Meet Our Team\n\n\nThe entire West LA Implants team is skilled at providing dental implants in Los Angeles, CA, and from the first time you enter our office, our goal is to treat you like family. Dr. Barriere places hundreds of dental implants each year, and he is likewise experienced in providing related services, including tooth extraction and bone grafting.\n\n\n#### Plan Your Perfect Smile\n\n\nIntraoral scanners and cone-beam computed tomography (CBCT) scans allow Dr. Barriere to create a precise roadmap of what your treatment will look like, and smile simulation technology allows him to share this vision with you. You can give feedback and make changes before you even begin treatment! The more ideas you have about your perfect smile, the more tools we’ll have to achieve it!\n\n\n#### Create a Custom Treatment Plan\n\n\nWe don’t offer “cookie-cutter” treatment at West LA Implants. Instead, we’ll offer you customized treatment plans based on your vision and your exact needs. Your smile should be as unique as the rest of you! We want you to take an active role in your oral health, and that means you get to choose what works best for you.\n\n\n#### Cost and Payment Options\n\n\nThe West LA Implants team believes that cost shouldn’t be a barrier to lasting health. That’s why we offer in-house and third-party financing on dental implant surgery, and we are also in-network with many leading insurance providers. We even offer a dental savings plan!\n\n\n#### Receiving Your Dental Implants\n\n\nIf you decide that dental implants are the best option for you, we’ll schedule you for your dental implant procedure. Dr. Barriere uses the most advanced technology for implant surgery, including the Yomi® robotic assistant, which means that your procedure will be done quickly and efficiently. We offer IV sedation as well as oral sedation and nitrous oxide (known commonly as “laughing gas”), so your nerves don’t have to stop you from getting the care you need.\n\nDr. Barriere Talks About Why Does Dental Implant Treatment Experience Matter?\n\n\n## The Most Valuable Option for Dental Implants\n\n\nUnlike many other dentists, Dr. Barriere is highly trained in implant dentistry. This means that he provides the best value for your money in all of Los Angeles. His commitment to continuing education and his adoption of the highest-end technology mean that you’ll always be in good hands at West LA Implants. You’ll also find a wide variety of amenities in our office, ensuring a comfortable and safe environment.\n\n\n## Our Patients tell the story best\n\n\n\n##### \"Full Arch All-On-4 Gave Me My Confidence Back!\"\n\n\n\n##### Leslie - Full Arch All-On-4\n\n\n\n##### \"I Felt Like The Old Me Because Of My Crowns & Dental Implants\"\n\n\n\n##### Emily - Crowns & Dental Implants\n\n\n\n##### \"I Have Teeth Again Thanks To My Full Mouth Reconstruction!\"\n\n\n\n##### Michael - Full Mouth Reconstruction\n\n\n\n## Schedule An Appointment\n\n\nDesired Consult Date\n\nPreferred Method of Communication\n\nText\n\nPhone\n\nEmail\n\nSend\n\nI understand the information disclosed in this form may be subject to re-disclosure and may no longer be protected by HIPAA privacy regulations and the HITECH Act.\n\n\n### Find out if you're a\n\n\n\n## candidate for dental implants\n\n\n\n#### Answer the Following Questions To Learn more about our pricing and financing options.\n\n\nFacebook Instagram Youtube Yelp Google\n\n\n#### Contact Us\n\n\nAddress:\n\n12301 Wilshire Blvd Suite 205,\n\nLos Angeles, CA 90025\n\n(310) 481-0111\n\n\n#### Hours\n\n\nMonday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nTuesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nWednesday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nThursday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nFriday: 9:00am – 5:00pm\n\nSaturday: Closed\n\nSunday: Closed\n\n\n#### Services\n\n\n\n#### About Us\n\n\nPrivacy Policy\n\nDental Website by Progressive Dental Marketing",
